# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #05 (abyssea 105, op 578): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Verglas_Golem (19 placed spawns, the first 17813756). The next op (#06, Olyphant) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #05
# accepted (a GM), this op available: a Verglas_Golem killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM;
# activeDominionOp stays 0, which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): a Verglas_Golem killed: dominionOnMobDeath(578):
# Quest[8][105]Prog 1 (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Olyphant killed: Quest[8][106]Prog 1 (its own count),
# this op's unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is false):
# nothing. Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing.
# Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible
# and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Verglas_Golem/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Olyphant/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp06Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp05Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #05
quest Abyssea.DominionOp05Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #05
kill #17813756                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp05Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813757                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813776                          # Olyphant: Quest[8][106]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][105]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813758                          # Prog 5
kill #17813759                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp05Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][105]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813760                          # completed: nothing
